[17]About me

     Senior Engineering Leader | 20+ years building reliable, scalable,
     and high-impact software systems
     I help teams design, deliver, and operate platforms that make
     software delivery faster, safer, and more reliable. My experience
     spans companies like Klarna, Cisco, Tobii and Schibsted/Vend,
     leading efforts across infrastructure, data, and developer
     platforms.
     I care about outcomes — clear goals, strong technical foundations,
     and teams that can move with confidence. I focus on reducing
     friction, improving developer productivity, and building systems
     that scale well without adding unnecessary complexity.
     Focus areas: engineering leadership, platform strategy, reliability,
     developer experience, and data-driven delivery.

